4. Create a function that can be used to determine if Britney Spears sang the song. 

```{r}
AndTheBritneySongWasOn <- function(artist){
  ifelse(artist == "Spears, Britney", "yes", "no")
}

billboard$britneySong <- AndTheBritneySongWasOn(billboard$artist)



```



